# Grid B — U7 History / No-Hit Scope Without Window Enumeration
#
# Regression target: a bounded zero-result VCS history answer should preserve
# the absence proof and searched scope without turning the searched commit
# window itself into the principal answer table. This protects the
# result_count=0 + searched-window support-ledger contract.
ID="u7p"
NAME="history — no-hit scope without searched-window enumeration"
ABSENT_MARKER="definitely_no_such_marker_20260523"_"window_support"
QUESTION="最近 20 次提交里有没有提到 ${ABSENT_MARKER}？如果没有，请只说明搜索范围和 0 命中结论，不需要逐个列出每个提交。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：** Required.Principal.Member.Set"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(没有|未发现|未找到|0).*(${ABSENT_MARKER}|最近 20 次|20 次提交)|(${ABSENT_MARKER}|最近 20 次|20 次提交).*(没有|未发现|未找到|0)"
